title: "reproducible-network-pharmacology"
abstract: >-
  A command-line toolkit and agent skill for reproducible network-pharmacology
  analysis: audited parsing of SwissTargetPrediction exports, gene-symbol
  normalization, compound–target–disease intersection, Cytoscape network tables,
  enrichment via R clusterProfiler, module analysis, and per-run provenance.
